Maintainer: trans <transfire@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), crystal, build-essential, libssl-dev, libpcre2-dev, libgc-dev, zlib1g-dev, libbrotli-dev, libzstd-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/trans/bai

Package: bai
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: xclip, wl-clipboard
Description: Translate natural-language shell requests into proposed commands
 bai is a small Crystal CLI that turns natural-language shell requests
 into a proposed command string. It never executes the command itself;
 it prints the result so the user stays in control of approval and execution.
